&P512357 = BAP 080 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. {disz}pa-la-{d}utu a-na a-pil-i3-li2-szu 
#tr.ts: pala-šamaš ana apil-ilīšu
#tr.en: Pala-šamaš against Apil-ilīšu

2. isz-tu zi-i-zu i-tu-ur2 ir-gu-um-ma 
#tr.ts: ištu zīzū itūr irgumma 
#tr.en: has reverted (to the division of the inheritance) and raised a claim after they had shared so

3. _di-ku5-mesz_ u3 szi-bu-ut a-lim ik#-szu#-du-u2-ma 
#tr.ts: dayyānī u šībut ālim ikšudūma
#tr.en: they have approached the judges and the elders of the city.

4. _e2_ ma-la i-ba-asz-szu-u2 
#tr.ts: bītam mala ibaššū
#tr.en: The house as much as there was

5. u3 il-ka-am mi-it-ha-[ri-isz] i-zu-zu 
#tr.ts: u ilkam mitḫāriš izūzū
#tr.en: and the service they have shared together.

6. u2-ul i-tu-ur2-ru-u2-ma 
#tr.ts: ul iturrūma
#tr.en: (That) again (lit. they will not return (on the matter) and)

7. a-hu-um a-na a-hi-im u2-ul i-ra-gu-um 
#tr.ts: aḫum ana aḫim ul ira(g)gum
#tr.en: brother against brother will not raise a claim

8. _mu_ {d}utu {d}marduk u3 ha-am-mu-ra-pi2 _lugal-e_ 
#tr.ts: nīš šamaš marduk u ḫammurapi šarrim
#tr.en: (by) the name of Šamaš, Marduk and Ḫammurapi the king

9. _in-pa3-de3-mesz_ 
#tr.ts: itmû
#tr.en: they have sworn.

$ single ruling 
10. _igi_ {d}nanna-tum ra-bi-a-nu-um 
#tr.ts: maḫar nannatum rabiānum
#tr.en: Before Nannatum, the mayor;

11. _igi_ sin-i-din-nam u3 {d}utu-ri-isz 
#tr.ts: maḫar sîn-i(d)dinam u šamaš-rīš
#tr.en: before Sîn-iddinam and Šamaš-rīš

12. _dumu-mesz_ ARAD2-{d}utu 
#tr.ts: mārī warad-šamaš
#tr.en: sons of Warad-šamaš;

13. _igi_ puzur4-{d}nin-kar#-ra#-ak 
#tr.ts: maḫar puzur-gula
#tr.en: before Puzur-gula

14. _dumu_ sin-e-ri-ba-am 
#tr.ts: mār sîn-erībam
#tr.en: son of Sîn-erībam;

15. _igi_ ap-pa-tum _dumu_ [ip-qu2-sza] 
#tr.ts: maḫar (ḫ)appatum mār ipquša
#tr.en: before Ḫappatum son of Ipquša;

